<title>PORTUGAL: Yield easies on Portugal one-year bills.</title>
<headline>Yield easies on Portugal one-year bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield eased to 6.0181 percent, from 6.474 percent previously, at the Treasury's sale of 15 billion escudos of 361-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The last such sale was on November 14.</p>
<p>The full amount on offer was placed.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
